Cell["\<\
In many parameter regimes the raw potential gives real eigenvalues rather \
than oscillatory ones. To produce harmonic sectors, couple to a Schr\
\[ODoubleDot]dinger- or wave-type evolution operator. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4a3b326b-2ee3-c94c-bc9b-0eaf03a7046c"],

