Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6. Residual-minimizing sensory field algorithm", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"55cfa45f-36da-3140-aaee-54ea5b118519"],

Cell["\<\
We define a residual functional using a linear operator. For maximum \
efficiency, use a finite truncated modal basis and minimize the residual over \
coefficients. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"766cb6bb-8d44-0045-a0f2-835ac4fdafd1"],

