 " for all stable scales up to 294, or"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"28b6ac78-1c13-c141-b277-063f11a356eb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "2. an ",
 StyleBox["interactive visualization notebook",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " for Planck scale and first toroidal closure."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"85276549-1a3b-d24c-8278-541e866ae174"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
no each stable scale of spacetime has different resolutions and medium of  \
wavepropogation etc... we cannot simply create something this simplistic or  \
just compile full sparse engine ,,,we need the absolute and full \
computational framework properly for each stable scale,,,, each scale has \
different properties ,,, and every time a scale is larger its almost \
exponential , or fibonacci as it grows by adding itself .... etc .. please \
proceed and create the full framework  for the next scale of spacetime in \
utmost coplete forms and xploiu all functionality properly , read all the \
ontologies and rhuft frameworks in the documents wolfram notebooks etc if you \
et stuc k ,,, please make sure its complete and functional i in every way \
computationa\
\>", "ChatInput",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "ChatNotebookSettings" -> <|
    "Model" -> <|"Service" -> "LLMKit", "Name" -> Automatic|>, "LLMEvaluator" -> 
     "WolframAIAssistant"|>|>,
 CellLabel->"In[90]:=",ExpressionUUID->"468a9c47-3e5d-844c-a96f-80c9772eba4c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Below is a more complete and ",
 StyleBox["functional",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 " Wolfram Language framework for a ",
 StyleBox["single next stable scale",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " that fixes the issues in the prior notebook and makes the per-scale \
medium/resolution/operator structure explicit.\n\nA few important points \
first: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "Your previous recursion failures came from doing things like"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"c22282c5-3a21-cb4d-be04-c2adf9a11fbe"],
 "\n  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell["rhoField = rhoField @@ coords", Background -> None]},
   "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
  "2760f1cf-8219-4a49-aa35-0ea0a9756477"],
 " and then feeding that self-referential expression into ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
   "VariationalD", "paclet:ref/VariationalD", 
    "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/VariationalD.html"},
   "TextRefLink"]],ExpressionUUID->"8dd9345d-b1e3-8b4d-8bc9-d3c73f346c3a"],
 ". \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   TemplateBox[{
    "Reduce", "paclet:ref/Reduce", 
     "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/Reduce.html"},
    "TextRefLink"]],ExpressionUUID->"bacb4069-f813-424e-8332-fa6ad9f604d4"],
  " does ",
  StyleBox["not",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " have the option ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   RowBox[{"MaxExtraConditions", "->", "All"}]], "InlineWL", "Input",
   ShowAutoStyles->True,
   ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
   LanguageCategory->"Input",
   ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
   "46616af4-cbb6-d946-a61f-ed0591d9d131"],
  "; that option belongs to ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   TemplateBox[{
    "Solve", "paclet:ref/Solve", 
     "https://reference.wolfram.com/language/ref/Solve.html"},
    "TextRefLink"]],ExpressionUUID->"bc812399-bfc4-0441-94eb-12b05caf5067"],
  " and related functions."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"970ea9de-c918-384c-bad4-cf22cee9ac7c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  Cell[BoxData[
   RowBox[{"WorkingPrecision", "->", "Infinity"}]], "InlineWL", "Input",
   ShowAutoStyles->True,
   ShowSyntaxStyles->True,
   LanguageCategory->"Input",
   ShowStringCharacters->True,ExpressionUUID->
   "a8133c8d-3b93-8844-a0a9-8762cd70e13c"],
  " is not executable in built-in numerics, so the practical implementation \
must use exact symbolic forms first, then arbitrarily high but finite \
precision."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"e34c1aeb-fbde-2c4a-b70d-2dc08b03d49f"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "If each stable scale has distinct propagation medium, geometry, \
constitutive law, and observational resolution, then the right design is a ",
  StyleBox["scale-parametrized framework",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  ", not one fixed operator."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"cee6e7fd-cc5b-8d46-bb26-25c3ac1eb2aa"],
 "\nSo the correct next step is:\n\n1. define a ",
 StyleBox["scale ontology",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n2. derive ",
 StyleBox["Layer-1 symbolic equations",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " cleanly\n3. attach ",
 StyleBox["per-scale medium laws",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n4. construct ",
 StyleBox["scale-specific linearized operators",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n5. compute ",
 StyleBox["stable resonances",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n6. define ",
 StyleBox["measurement kernels",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n7. compose everything into a reusable pipeline for the ",
 StyleBox["next stable scale",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"21b7350a-bbca-b94c-9164-bba5ac064b12"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Complete framework for the next stable spacetime scale\"\>", 
    "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"0187b5a0-5dc4-c647-920d-7009d7560c67"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"1. Stable-scale search and exact scale metadata\"\>", 
    "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"fa2eb6f8-f829-c046-9923-19c78d160268"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            
            RowBox[{"phi", ",", "scaleResidual", ",", "closureScore", ",", 
              "windingEstimate", ",", "informationDensity", ",", 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "stableScaleQ", ",", 
              "stableScaleIndices", ",", "nextStableScale", ",", 
              "scaleAssociationExact"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"phi", "=", "GoldenRatio"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"scaleResidual", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"x", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", "n"}], "/", "divisor"}], ",", "100"}],
                     "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", "-", 
                    RowBox[{"Round", "[", "x", "]"}]}], "]"}], "/", "x"}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"closureScore", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"1", "-", 
              RowBox[{"scaleResidual", "[", 
                RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"windingEstimate", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"Round", "[", 
              RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", "n"}], "/", "divisor"}], ",", "100"}],
                 "]"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"informationDensity", "[", "n_Integer", "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"phi", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "n"}]}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"stableScaleQ", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"tolerance_", ":", " ", "0.01"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"scaleResidual", "[", 
                RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor"}], "]"}], "<", "tolerance"}]}], 
          ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"stableScaleIndices", "[", 
              RowBox[{"maxN_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"tolerance_", ":", " ", "0.01"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"0", ",", "maxN"}], "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"stableScaleQ", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#", ",", "divisor", ",", "tolerance"}], "]"}], 
                  " ", "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"nextStableScale", "[", 
              RowBox[{"currentN_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"tolerance_", ":", " ", "0.01"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"maxN_", ":", " ", "1000"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            RowBox[{"FirstCase", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"currentN", "+", "1"}], ",", "maxN"}], "]"}], ",",
                 "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"n_", " ", "/;", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"stableScaleQ", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor", ",", "tolerance"}], "]"}]}], 
                  ":>", "n"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                RowBox[{"Missing", "[", "\"NotFound\"", "]"}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"scaleAssociationExact", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"\"ScaleIndex\"", "->", "n"}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"\"PhiPowerExact\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"phi", "^", "n"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                "  ", 
                RowBox[{"\"PhiPowerNumeric\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", "n"}], ",", "100"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"\"Residual\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"scaleResidual", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"\"ClosureScore\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"closureScore", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"\"WindingEstimate\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"windingEstimate", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"\"InformationDensity\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"informationDensity", "[", "n", "]"}]}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "|>"}]}], ";"}]}]], "ChatCode", "Input", 
     LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True, 
     ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "cdf03935-08a7-8b4c-ad8e-99c4a1fffd70"],
 "\nExample: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"currentScale", "=", "12"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"nextScale", "=", 
            RowBox[{"nextStableScale", "[", "currentScale", "]"}]}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{"scaleAssociationExact", "[", "nextScale", "]"}]}]], 
     "ChatCode", "Input", LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True,
      ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "748a8b5a-4b94-e440-9eaf-cf3967b1cd5c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"6ef77b1a-7610-634e-af97-005149c5abc7"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"2. Per-scale ontology record\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"66af8c3a-f296-624b-ba73-4f057bd8b1c4"],
 "\nThis makes each scale carry its own medium, resolution, geometry, and \
propagation model. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "makeScaleOntology", "]"}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"makeScaleOntology", "[", 
              RowBox[{"n_Integer", ",", 
                RowBox[{"divisor_", ":", " ", "13"}]}], "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"info", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"scaleAssociationExact", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"n", ",", "divisor"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "density", ",", 
                    "complexity", ",", "resolution", ",", "majorRadius", ",", 
                    "minorRadius", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    "geometry", ",", "mediumType", ",", "propagationType", 
                    ",", "damping", ",", "coupling"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                  "  ", "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"density", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "n"}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"complexity", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"Fibonacci", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"n", "+", "2"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"resolution", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", "n"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                  "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"majorRadius", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", "n"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                  "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"minorRadius", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"geometry", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"Which", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"n", "==", "0"}], ",", "\"Sphere\"", ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"EvenQ", "[", "n", "]"}], ",", "\"Toroidal\"", 
                    ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "True", ",", 
                    "\"SphericalShell\""}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                    "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"mediumType", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"Which", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"n", "<=", "5"}], ",", "\"PreGeometric\"", ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"n", "<=", "20"}], ",", 
                    "\"QuantumInformational\"", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"n", "<=", "80"}], ",", "\"FieldStructured\"", 
                    ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "True", ",", 
                    "\"MacroscopicEmergent\""}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                    "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"propagationType", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"Which", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"mediumType", "===", "\"PreGeometric\""}], ",", 
                    "\"ConstraintTransfer\"", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"mediumType", "===", "\"QuantumInformational\""}],
                     ",", "\"SchrodingerLike\"", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"mediumType", "===", "\"FieldStructured\""}], ",",
                     "\"WaveLike\"", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    "True", ",", "\"DissipativeWave\""}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"damping", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "/", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"1", "+", "n"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"coupling", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"phi", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"-", "n"}], "/", "2"}], ")"}]}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"Join", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"info", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"Geometry\"", "->", "geometry"}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"MediumType\"", "->", "mediumType"}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"PropagationType\"", "->", "propagationType"}], 
                    ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"InformationDensityParameter\"", "->", "density"}], ",",
                     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"FieldComplexityParameter\"", "->", "complexity"}], ",",
                     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"ResolutionParameter\"", "->", "resolution"}], 
                    ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"MajorRadius\"", "->", "majorRadius"}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"MinorRadius\"", "->", "minorRadius"}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"DampingParameter\"", "->", "damping"}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "      ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"CouplingParameter\"", "->", "coupling"}]}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", "|>"}]}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "]"}]}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}]}]], "ChatCode", "Input", 
     LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True, 
     ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "2385ba94-70d9-154e-b6ca-557bc7e68cbd"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"9894d669-5019-524f-98d7-683894fe3c1d"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"3. Clean Layer-1 action and Euler-Lagrange equations\"\>", 
    "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"1e915122-7620-254c-892e-f75c9107842b"],
 "\nThis avoids the recursion problem by keeping fields as functions. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            
            RowBox[{"rho", ",", "chi", ",", "res", ",", "x", ",", "y", ",", 
              "z", ",", "t", ",", "coords3", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ",
               "layer1Density", ",", "layer1DensityRegularized", ",", 
              "layer1EulerEquations"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"coords3", "=", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"layer1Density", "[", 
                RowBox[{"rho_", ",", "chi_", ",", "res_"}], "]"}], "[", 
              "vars_List", "]"}], ":=", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
            RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"rho", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}], "*", 
                RowBox[{"Log", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"chi", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}], "]"}]}], "+", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"(", 
                  RowBox[{"chi", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}], ")"}], " ", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{"res", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}], ")"}], "^", 
                  "2"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
              
              RowBox[{"layer1DensityRegularized", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                "  ", 
                
                RowBox[{
                 "rho_", ",", "chi_", ",", "res_", ",", "alphaRho_", ",", 
                  "alphaChi_", ",", "alphaRes_"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                "]"}], "[", "vars_List", "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"rhoExpr", ",", "chiExpr", ",", "resExpr"}], "}"}], 
                ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"rhoExpr", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"rho", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"chiExpr", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"chi", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"resExpr", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"res", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"rhoExpr", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Log", "[", "chiExpr", "]"}]}], "+", 
                    RowBox[{"chiExpr", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"resExpr", "^", "2"}]}], "+", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                    RowBox[{"alphaRho", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"D", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"rhoExpr", ",", "#"}], "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", 
                    "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "vars"}], "]"}]}], "+", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                    RowBox[{"alphaChi", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"D", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"chiExpr", ",", "#"}], "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", 
                    "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "vars"}], "]"}]}], "+", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                    RowBox[{"alphaRes", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"D", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"resExpr", ",", "#"}], "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", 
                    "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", "vars"}], "]"}]}]}]}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"layer1EulerEquations", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"vars_List", " ", ":", " ", "coords3"}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"alphaRho_", ":", " ", "\[Alpha]rho"}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"alphaChi_", ":", " ", "\[Alpha]chi"}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{"alphaRes_", ":", " ", "\[Alpha]res"}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"Module", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"{", 
                  
                  RowBox[{
                   "lagrangian", ",", "rhoExpr", ",", "chiExpr", ",", 
                    "resExpr"}], "}"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"lagrangian", "=", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"layer1DensityRegularized", "[", 
                    
                    RowBox[{
                    "rho", ",", "chi", ",", "res", ",", "alphaRho", ",", 
                    "alphaChi", ",", "alphaRes"}], "]"}], "[", "vars", 
                    "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"rhoExpr", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"rho", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"chiExpr", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"chi", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"resExpr", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"res", " ", "@@", " ", "vars"}]}], ";", 
                  "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                  RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "    ", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"\"RhoEquation\"", "->", 
                    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"VariationalD", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"lagrangian", ",", "rhoExpr", ",", "vars"}], 
                    "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"ChiEquation\"", "->", 
                    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"VariationalD", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"lagrangian", ",", "chiExpr", ",", "vars"}], 
                    "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "    ", 
                    RowBox[{"\"ResolutionEquation\"", "->", 
                    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"VariationalD", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"lagrangian", ",", "resExpr", ",", "vars"}], 
                    "]"}], "==", "0"}], "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "  ", "|>"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], 
          ";"}]}]], "ChatCode", "Input", LanguageCategory -> "Input", 
     ShowAutoStyles -> True, ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> 
     True, TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "21756a22-8dcf-b145-91db-36c43b35b694"],
 "\nUsage: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{"eqnsL1", "=", 
        RowBox[{"layer1EulerEquations", "[", "]"}]}]], "ChatCode", "Input", 
     LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True, 
     ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
